            <title>[LU-19274] Add spelling check to checkpatch-man.pl</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19274</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;Reported by Andreas&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add spelling check to checkpatch-man.pl. We should probably add a custom dictionary to cover Lustre terms, so that existing man pages can check (mostly) clean, but it would help avoid simple errors in the future.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
