                            <comment id="497395" author="adilger" created="Tue, 7 Jul 2026 17:43:43 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=arshad512" class="user-hover" rel="arshad512"&gt;arshad512&lt;/a&gt; the 62211 patch landed with the `exa.dic` file was renamed to `lustre.dic` and is located in `rustreapi/.config/lustre.dic` (so not easily accessible), so checkpatch-man.pl now generates warnings when is run:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;sh: -c: line 0: syntax error near unexpected token `|'
sh: -c: line 0: `echo &amp;lt;stringh&amp;gt; | hunspell -a -n -p /usr/src/lustre-head/contrib/scripts/exa.dic'
sh: -c: line 0: syntax error near unexpected token `|'
sh: -c: line 0: `echo &amp;lt; | hunspell -a -n -p /usr/src/lustre-head/contrib/scripts/exa.dic'
sh: -c: line 0: syntax error near unexpected token `|'
sh: -c: line 0: `echo &amp;lt;stringh&amp;gt; | hunspell -a -n -p /usr/src/lustre-head/contrib/scripts/exa.dic'
